'''Edmund Elisala (Ieremia) Stansbury''' (born May 3, 1979) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] [[Fullback (gridiron football)|fullback]] in the [[National Football League]] (NFL), and a prominent sports figure in [[El Paso, Texas]]. Stansbury had a standout athletic career at the high school, collegiate, and professional levels and has since made significant contributions to his community as an ambassador for sports.
